00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:27.330
with a real view to understand the utility

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:30.180
of conceptual models, simulations,

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:35.040
arguments that are
particular to a discipline

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.630
