01:13:52.590 --> 01:13:55.470
or is it a very different
kind of provisionality

01:13:55.470 --> 01:13:57.993
that doesn't sort of go in that direction?

01:13:59.760 --> 01:14:02.010
- Yeah, I mean, there is
a field of mathematics

01:14:02.010 --> 01:14:06.093
