01:14:07.350 --> 01:14:09.600
and there it's, there's lots of things

01:14:09.600 --> 01:14:12.900
like probabilistic proofs and, you know,

01:14:12.900 --> 01:14:15.423
the kind of arguments that I discussed.

01:14:16.740 --> 01:14:20.553
So I mean, it could be,

01:14:23.790 --> 01:14:27.120
I mean, one of the things, okay,
one of the things that you,

01:14:27.120 --> 01:14:29.370
one of the types of
evidence that I've described

01:14:29.370 --> 01:14:32.190
is like what's known as
inductive evidence, right?

01:14:32.190 --> 01:14:33.023
You just have more.

01:14:33.023 --> 01:14:34.260
You have a lot of As that are Bs

01:14:34.260 --> 01:14:35.710
and you infer that As are Bs.

01:14:36.690 --> 01:14:38.580
So that's typical of science,

01:14:38.580 --> 01:14:41.850
but you also get another more
