01:14:41.850 --> 01:14:44.940
more subtle form of argument
that happens in science,

01:14:44.940 --> 01:14:47.130
which is inference of
the best explanation.

01:14:47.130 --> 01:14:50.760
You get different phenomena and then they,

01:14:50.760 --> 01:14:53.220
you can find one explanation
